credit the Greek edition to John Burnet, Platonis Opera, Clarendon Press.

Changes
-------

This repository converts the source TEI XML into a simplified HTML reading
edition. The build removes notes and most TEI markup, aligns English and Greek
by Stephanus section, groups dialogues on the index, and adds navigation and
presentation. The wording of the Perseus texts is not intentionally revised.

This is an unofficial, independently generated mirror. The texts,
translations, and scholarly editions are not the work of this repository's
maintainer. No affiliation with or endorsement by the Perseus Digital Library,
Tufts University, Harvard University Press, the Loeb Classical Library, or any
author, editor, translator, publisher, or data provider is implied.
